 kind of nervous.","약간 긴장돼요."],["I'm kind of busy right now.","지금 좀 바빠요."]]},{"cat":"상태·감정","form":"I'm worried about + 명사","meaning":"~이 걱정돼요","examples":[["I'm worried about the weather.","날씨가 걱정돼요."],["I'm worried about my friend.","친구가 걱정돼요."]]},{"cat":"상태·감정","form":"I'm excited about + 명사","meaning":"~이 기대돼요","examples":[["I'm excited about the trip.","여행이 기대돼요."],["I'm excited about the game.","게임이 기대돼요."]]},{"cat":"상태·감정","form":"I'm glad + 문장","meaning":"~해서 기뻐요","examples":[["I'm glad you're here.","당신이 여기 와서 기뻐요."],["I'm glad we met.","만나서 기뻐요."]]},{"cat":"상태·감정","form":"I'm sorry to + 동사원형","meaning":"~하게 되어 미안해요·안타까워요","examples":[["I'm sorry to hear that.","그 말을 들으니 안타까워요."],["I'm sorry to bother you.","귀찮게 해서 미안해요."]]},{"cat":"상태·감정","form":"I'm grateful for + 명사","meaning":"~에 감사해요","examples":[["I'm grateful for your help.","도와줘서 감사해요."],["I'm grateful for this opportunity.","이 기회에 감사해요."]]},{"cat":"상태·감정","form":"I'm not feeling well","meaning":"몸이 좋지 않아요","examples":[["I'm not feeling well today.","오늘 몸이 좋지 않아요."],["I'm not feeling well after lunch.","점심 먹고 몸이 안 좋아요."]]},{"cat":"상태·감정","form":"I'm good at + -ing","meaning":"~을 잘해요","examples":[["I'm good at drawing.","그림을 잘 그려요."],["I'm good at organizing games.","게임 진행을 잘해요."]]},{"cat":"상태·감정","form":"I'm having trouble + -ing","meaning":"~하는 데 어려움이 있어요","examples":[["I'm having trouble sleeping.","잠을 잘 못 자요."],["I'm having trouble understanding this.","이걸 이해하기 어려워요."]]},{"cat":"상태·감정","form":"I'm in the mood for + 명사","meaning":"~이 당겨요","examples":[["I'm in the mood for coffee.","커피가 당겨요."],["I'm in the mood for something sweet.","달콤한 게 당겨요."]]},{"cat":"상태·감정","form":"I can't wait to + 동사원형","meaning":"~하고 싶어 못 기다리겠어요","examples":[["I can't wait to meet everyone.","모두 만나고 싶어 기다리기 힘들어요."],["I can't wait to see you again.","다시 만나는 게 너무 기대돼요."]]},{"cat":"상태·감정","form":"I'm looking forward to + -ing","meaning":"~하기를 기대해요","examples":[["I'm looking forward to meeting you.","만나기를 기대하고 있어요."],["I'm loo